{"asset_key":"mn/herohub_story_10415029","episode":"mn","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"10415029","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1041502901:1":{"text":"ソーン、木苺っておいしいと思わない？","source_cn":"索恩，树莓味道很不错吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC3C487B04AF8C7E0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1041502902:1":{"text":"さっぱりしてて、種がないから食べやすい！","source_cn":"味道很清爽，又没有籽，吃起来很方便！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEA99D10E8A929545","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1041502903:1":{"text":"うっ……酸っぱい……","source_cn":"……嘶……好酸。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD6877AFAD3C96821","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1041502904:1":{"text":"えっ？ウソだぁ……少しも酸っぱくないじゃん！\nもしかしてソーンって、酸っぱいの苦手？","source_cn":"咦？我尝尝……不酸啊？\\n该不会索恩你很怕酸吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7BC3BC7431DD4EDF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1041502905:1":{"text":"少し……\nいやっ、ほんとにちょっとだけ。","source_cn":"有点。\\n……一点点。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB7CC5E2FDFCD4388","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1041502906:1":{"